  "_what_this_is": [
    "Query parameters that identify one click, one campaign or one recipient.",
    "`url.tracking-parameter` reports internal links that carry one: a value",
    "meant for a single visitor's arrival, served to everyone who reads the page.",
    "",
    "Hand-curated. Each entry cites the operator's own documentation. A parameter",
    "with only third-party evidence (Mailchimp's mc_cid / mc_eid, at the time of",
    "writing) stays out until its operator documents it.",
    "",
    "`match` is `exact` for a parameter name, or `prefix` for a family such as",
    "utm_*. Names are compared lowercase."
  ],

